OL,3,GNEWSACrossCountry plans 60,000 extra
OL,4,Atrain seats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers travelling between some of
OL,7,FBritain's biggest cities could have
OL,8,Faccess to 60,000 extra rail seats each
OL,9,Fweek under plans from CrossCountry.
OL,11,FThe eight additional trains would
OL,12,Fincrease capacity on services running
OL,13,Fthrough Birmingham to Glasgow, Penzance
OL,14,Fand Bournemouth, as well as Leeds,
OL,15,FLeicester, Sheffield, Cardiff,
OL,16,FCambridge and Manchester.
OL,18,FCrossCountry said the first of the
OL,19,Fextra Voyager trains would enter
OL,20,Fservice in early 2027, with the
OL,21,Fremainder arriving by May 2028.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
