OL,3,GNEWSACrossCountry plans 60,000 extra
OL,4,Atrain seats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after data from
OL,7,Fthe Office of Rail and Road (ORR)
OL,8,Fsuggested the operator's punctuality
OL,9,Ffell by more than six percentage points
OL,10,Fbetween April and June 2026 compared
OL,11,Fwith the same period in 2025.
